WEBVTT

00:00:29.185 --> 00:00:32.095
This was my first experience
with science fiction,

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:33.404
and I loved it.

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:37.078
So when I started to write
my own science fiction and fantasy,

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:39.596
I was surprised that it
was considered un-African.

00:00:40.294 --> 00:00:42.909
So naturally, I asked, what is African?

00:00:42.933 --> 00:00:44.793
And this is what I know so far:

00:00:45.735 --> 00:00:47.257
Africa is important.

00:00:48.023 --> 00:00:49.454
Africa is the future.

00:00:49.478 --> 00:00:50.744
It is, though.

00:00:51.254 --> 00:00:55.577
And Africa is a serious place
where only serious things happen.

00:00:55.601 --> 00:01:00.076
So when I present my work somewhere,
someone will always ask,